  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "5a9d53c375b320ca9d4c55e89bb1cd23",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        15
      ],
      "originalHash": "7ff39d60eca52849782ea352ab21c191fc0c19ec4bbad7b8c4985bc022e725e0",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "近づいてきた%YOU%は、それが落ちた場所を見ていた。腰をかがめ、%SEX%の足元で拾い上げる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ee4f7b0a521537f587d9a347346660ee",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "6bfb9209ae5f0958db823236b5e8beedfffe615bfd467915b6e561bf66b10229",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "%SEX%は%YOU%からタブレットを受け取り、非の打ち所のない礼で%YOU%に礼を述べると、立ち上がってここを去ろうとする。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "860ec098d7084c4323d18aab5b06bfd2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        27
      ],
      "originalHash": "c44b52c1f793a49e16b9330e20b5d5d4bd85dfcafafc12be8c6a15477bb2c609",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "（%CHARA%……？ 入職のとき渡された生徒資料で見た覚えがある。下に特別な注記があった。この%UMA%は体が弱く、出走に向かない。体の都合で選考を何度も逃している、と。）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "05ff341ce570235e5a5ccb05005ee259",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        30,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "5c5f3ce8e1bb998aa1c427b8ad495e0004ad15604098d53b4a2a7086e6a8a031",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%は突然の誘いにはっとした顔を見せたが、すぐに微笑みを取り戻し、軽く首を横に振る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ef43b2d380ac6fd898199fe03754f34f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        30,
        "lines",
        5,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d04ce4735430e9730f396985719518ce4ae7cbc002248d8d9c33e5feee0460b7",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "「ええ……誤解なさらないで。%CALLNAME%さんをお断りするのは、あなたご自身のせいではありません。いま誰が誘っても、同じようにお断りします。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5074a5c5d69861ae4969632c0533a2aa",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_1",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_1",
        30,
        "lines",
        15,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "c6980d6f6be1dcee1102f6f95dc58d399bcbc5f4f5de97083d958d84c5aefa8d",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "「ありがとうございます。選考のあと、お待ちしています。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dc23f0b43ed3d0c4d9fb3005a0088660",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_2",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_2",
        1,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "880d50ff0906d325d9666ca2ffabeba756c45efadac8ca52ab99146472545789",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "声を聞いた%CHARA%は顔を上げ、%YOU%だとわかると微笑み、柔らかく温かい声で尋ねる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8f8944c6389cf964a8a215c37feb81c3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
