      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        4,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "e698b624df03cb72fef4fe2338c8d5380c8b4e86b3cc62d54dbaaf8f8431af49",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "「どうして%SEX%が今日の予選に？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d12081a969205c8462aeccf91c655333",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "3c3b085e9e8d803761b384891f3f845ddddd7ffbb3502d79b4c95e32c8a03442",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "レースが進み、%SEX%がちょうど%YOU%の前を駆け抜ける。紫水晶の瞳は、あの日と同じ、微塵も揺るがない覚悟だった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3abf5220e885ee5d80635d1d70f2934a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        21
      ],
      "originalHash": "a2bf534ec03545335605ee5def44db94d5d48031960c2e8ef37b6ec119e421d9",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "約束どおり輝きを見届けに来た%YOU%を見て微笑む%CHARA%のそばへ行き、%YOU%はもう一度誘う。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "347bf8de7aaf02a6e7bd3922408f5a36",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "4156153658372ed79ce6bdb62ce39c6f3f41e3f8b3cb8b19029430fcdde6796d",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "%CHARA%は%YOU%の言葉を聞くと、わずかに頭を下げ、すぐに上げて%SEX%の揺るがない視線を%YOU%へ向ける。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a6d1eac29e4a3b54b318a6c94d62044c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/rec-71.kojo",
      "key": "recruit_3",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "recruit_3",
        24,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "6792dd343b20be1337d6898479aa507e6564a0061f6370d5097b5d7085a4fa6e",
      "sourceFileHash": "1306d9eebfc11b03064aadb9601f3bc5d1cec7e31242f68c981b873accc97512",
      "originalText": "「光栄です。これからの道を、あなたと一緒に歩み、頂へ登らせてください。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    }
  ]
